---
description: Vascurra repository-wide product, safety and design rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before suggesting or applying changes.

Vascurra Phase 1 is a public information website only. Do not invent clinical claims, health scores, certifications, evidence, partnerships, testimonials or diagnostic functionality.

Use the documentation under `/docs` as the source of truth. If a request conflicts with `docs/clinical/intended-purpose-and-claims.md`, surface the conflict before editing.

Preserve the visual language described in `docs/brand/brand-guidelines.md` and the technical boundaries in `docs/technical/architecture.md`.
